# Issue #318 regression — an xsd:dateTime with a timezone offset is not
# orderable against an xsd:dateTime bound without one (and vice versa); the
# mismatch must violate. A timezone-less value equal to a timezone-less
# bound must still conform normally.
# https://github.com/daghovland/rdf-datalog/issues/318
PREFIX ex: <http://example.com/ns#>
PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

ex:SameNaive ex:when "2002-10-10T12:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime .
ex:Timezoned ex:when "2002-10-10T12:00:00-05:00"^^xsd:dateTime .
